<h3 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="overview">Overview</h3>
<p>This project investigates genomic divergence in <em>Pegoscapus</em> fig wasps and how it contributes to adaptation and speciation.</p>
</section>
<section id="methods" class="level3">
<h3 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="methods">Methods</h3>
<ul>
<li>Whole-genome sequencing (PacBio HiFi + Illumina)</li>
<li>Population genomics analyses (π, dXY, F_ST)</li>
<li>Selection scans across chemosensory genes</li>
</ul>
